     "fish_special_nemo"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "d_crush",
   "lines": [
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_crush",
     "Hey there, Jellyman! The offspring and I had one righteous thrill surfin' the current 'til we found you, dude! Squirt here almost wiped out but I caught him just in time.",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_squirt",
     "It was so totally cool!",
     "fish_special_crush"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_crush",
     "--- And so here we are, dude.",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "Well, hello, Crush. Welcome to our little piece of reef. What brings you by?",
     "fish_special_crush"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_crush",
     "Turns out, the little dude is a much better student than I was. Hard to believe - I know. Anyway, he's been chosen to be an exchange student at your little dude's school...",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "Squirt! That is so awesome!",
     "fish_special_squirt"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_squirt",
     "Yeah! Now me and my dad get to stay here with you!",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_crush",
     "Whoah, better not get ahead of ourselves, Squirt. What do you say, mini-man, can the offspring and I crash here for awhile?",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "I guess so. As long as the boys don't get into too much trouble. Nemo?",
     "fish_special_crush"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "Nemo!",
     "fish_special_crush"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "Yeah, Dad? I was just showing Squirt our anemone...",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "See? You always have to keep an eye on them.",
     "fish_special_crush"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_crush",
     "Aw, I'm sure they'll be fine. I was way more reckless when I was their age.",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "Really? I never would have guessed that.",
     "fish_special_crush"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "Hey, Dad! Dad! Squirt said it would be cool if we had a stream here. What should we do?",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "Well, I suppose you could find a spring bubbling out from a crack somewhere. You know, like a geyser -",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "That's a great idea! Thanks Dad!",
     "fish_special_marlin"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "They can't get into trouble looking for a stream, right?",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "d_squirt",
   "lines": [
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_squirt",
     "Nemo! This place is totally sweet!",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "Thanks! I made it all by myself.",
     "fish_special_squirt"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "Ahem...",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "I mean, with my dad. But I did most of the planting!",
     "fish_special_squirt"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_squirt",
     "That is so cool! Can I help?",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "Sure! That would be great. Now I'm definitely gonna beat Tad.",
     "fish_special_squirt"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_squirt",
     "Who's Tad? You talk about him a lot.",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "He's in my class. He's kind of obnox-",
     "fish_special_squirt"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_marlin",
     "Nemo, be nice.",
     "fish_special_nemo"
    ],
    [
     "right",
     "fish_special_nemo",
     "Umm... Tad thinks he's gonna have a better reef than I do.",
     "fish_special_squirt"
    ],
    [
     "left",
     "fish_special_squirt",
     "No way. Not if I help you! C'mon!",
     "fish_special_nemo"
